### [TC-4-06] 정지 기간 중 출입 → 409, 기록 · 차감 없음
# @expect 409
# @expect $.errorCode == "ATTENDANCE_MEMBERSHIP_PAUSED"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM attendance_record WHERE member_id = 2 => 0
# @db SELECT remaining_count FROM membership WHERE id = 2 => 10
POST {{host}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 2 }

### [TC-4-07] 진행 중 정지를 당일 해제 → 사용 1일, 미사용 2일만큼 종료일 되돌림, 즉시 ACTIVE
# @uses todayPauseId = [TC-4-06-준비].$.pauseId
# @expect 200
# @expect $.usedDays == 1
# @expect $.membershipEndDate == "2027-03-02"
# @db SELECT end_date FROM membership WHERE id = 2 => 2027-03-02
# @db SELECT status FROM membership WHERE id = 2 => ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/memberships/2/pauses/{{todayPauseId}}/release
X-Branch-Id: 1

### [TC-4-12] 해제 당일 출입 → 409 (해제 당일까지 정지, D-8)
# @expect 409
# @expect $.errorCode == "ATTENDANCE_MEMBERSHIP_PAUSED"
# @db SELECT COUNT(*) FROM attendance_record WHERE member_id = 2 => 0
POST {{host}}/api/attendances
Content-Type: application/json
X-Branch-Id: 1

{ "memberId": 2 }

### [TC-4-10] 이미 해제된 정지 재해제 → 409, 종료일 불변
# @uses todayPauseId = [TC-4-06-준비].$.pauseId
